&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Design, implement, and improve robotics software platforms&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Drive architectural improvements and reduce technical debt in critical robotics components&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
