&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Investigate and resolve complex software issues, including those reported from robotic deployments, and deliver lasting solutions&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Collaborate with product owners and engineers from various disciplines to translate real-world automation challenges into well-engineered robotics solutions&lt;/div&gt;
