&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re open&lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;We are inclusive and collaborative; we encourage the free exchange of ideas; we respect and celebrate diverse views. We are open-minded: to new ideas, new partnerships, new ways of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re optimistic&lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span id=&quot;628d56ad5d8a35dab853e65d9daa237c&quot; class=&quot;editor-module-hl-green-solid&quot;&gt;We believe&lt;/span&gt; in the power of creativity, technology and talent to create brighter futures or our people, our clients and our communities. We approach all that we do with conviction: to try the new and to seek the unexpected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re extraordinary:&lt;/strong&gt; we are stronger together: through collaboration we achieve the amazing. We are creative leaders and pioneers of our industry; we provide extraordinary every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;ll give you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionate, inspired people&lt;/strong&gt; – We aim to create a culture in which people can do extraordinary work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale and opportunity&lt;/strong&gt; – We offer the opportunity to create, influence and complete projects at a scale that is unparalleled in the industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Challenging and stimulating work&lt;/strong&gt; – Unique work and the opportunity to join a group of creative problem solvers. Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&quot;&gt;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&lt;/a&gt;) for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Deliveroo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to transform the way people shop and eat, bringing the neighbourhood to your door by connecting consumers, restaurants, shops and riders. We are a technology-driven company at the forefront of one of the most rapidly expanding industries in the world: a complex, always-on, three-sided marketplace that impacts millions of people every day.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we&#39;re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;BizOps is the team that keeps its finger on the pulse of business performance: continuously, rigorously, and across multiple dimensions at once. We turn raw operational and financial data into actionable intelligence, surfacing &lt;em&gt;what&lt;/em&gt; is happening, &lt;em&gt;why&lt;/em&gt; it is happening, and &lt;em&gt;what to expect next&lt;/em&gt;, for the operators, executives, and functional teams who run the business day to day.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are not a reporting function that produces outputs on request. We work continuously, proactively watching, delivering, and questioning whether the signal is real, acting as &quot;first responders&quot; to surprising deviations from expectation and using what we learn to drive faster, better decision-making for the business at large.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our work spans the full stack of analytics: from the warehouse models that make metrics trustworthy, to the monitoring systems that catch problems early, to the reports and dashboards that make performance visible, to the deep-dive investigations that explain what the numbers mean and what we should do about it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We anchor our analysis to the right reference points: how performance compares to plan, to prior periods, and to what we&#39;d expect, and we bring causal rigour when the business needs to know whether an action actually worked.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The culture within the team is informal, fast-paced and entrepreneurial. Given the growth of the business and the level of senior stakeholder exposure, progression in the team can be fast.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is hiring a Senior Data Scientist to join BizOps, based in our London HQ (hybrid, minimum three days per week in the office).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This role is largely project-based: starting from a strategic or performance question, you&#39;ll combine data, business context, and structured problem-solving to provide the insights that drive decision-making at a global level with senior stakeholders. You will own delivery end-to-end, from the messy, ambiguous question to a rigorous, trustworthy, and actionable answer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be equally comfortable building the systems that make performance visible and going deep on the investigations that explain it. One week you might diagnose why a key market has moved away from plan; the next, identify the drivers behind a change in customer or operational performance; the next, build monitoring that helps teams spot and understand emerging issues earlier.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Success in this role requires building effective working relationships across Deliveroo, particularly with international markets, as well as the Data Science, Operations, Commercial, and Finance teams.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Answer the questions that matter, continuously.&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain a rigorous view on business performance: &lt;em&gt;Are we on track against our goals? What&#39;s changed? How does this compare with what we expected? What should we expect next?&lt;/em&gt; Then go further: &lt;em&gt;Why is it happening, what matters most, and what should we do about it?”&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own delivery end-to-end.&lt;/strong&gt; Independently identify, define, and deliver impactful work aligned with business goals, operating with minimal guidance to ship fast, high-quality solutions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Navigate ambiguity.&lt;/strong&gt; Deconstruct broad, ambiguous problem spaces into structured analytical roadmaps, and understand how your work intersects with adjacent systems and teams.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build for scale, not one-offs.&lt;/strong&gt; Build the pipelines, models, dashboards, monitoring, and investigative tooling that make performance visible and reliable. Automate wherever possible; redoing analyses by hand is slow and error-prone.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measure impact with discipline.&lt;/strong&gt; Design measurement strategies from simple A/B tests to quasi-experimental designs (synthetic control, difference-in-differences, event studies) when trials aren&#39;t feasible, always with conservative, assumption-explicit language.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be a first responder.&lt;/strong&gt; Surface deviations before they become escalations, and be just as willing to give the confident &quot;this is noise, no action needed&quot; as the alarm.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicate to influence.&lt;/strong&gt; Translate complex findings into clear, simple, actionable recommendations for both technical and non-technical audiences that shape roadmaps and decisions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the bar.&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to the broader Analytics community, improve shared approaches and best practices, and help build data literacy across the business.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Need to Thrive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our ideal candidate brings strong expertise in some of these areas and the curiosity to grow in others:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience in an analytical or data science role, such as data analytics, data science, forecasting, planning, strategy analytics, or a similar discipline. Experience in logistics, e-commerce, marketplaces, or another fast-moving, customer-focused business is useful but not essential.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Proficiency with SQL and a scripting language such as Python or R, alongside experience with BI or visualisation tooling such as Looker, Tableau, or similar.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Comfortable using modern AI-assisted tools to work efficiently while maintaining high standards of accuracy and reproducibility.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;A pragmatic approach to problem-solving: you can balance analytical rigour with speed, adapt your approach to the importance of the decision, and focus effort where it will have the greatest impact.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Effective problem-solving: you can take an ambiguous question, identify the underlying problem or decision, develop hypotheses, and use data and business context to reach a clear point of view.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience with experimentation and/or causal inference is a strong plus: the ability to unpick insights and steer strategic decisions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Excellent communication skills, in person, in writing, and in code, with the ability to translate business needs into analytical problems and complex findings into simple recommendations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Driven, hard-working, and agile. BizOps sits at the centre of a fast-growing business; we move quickly to scale at pace.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;London-based, with a minimum of three days per week in the office.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you&#39;ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that&#39;s constantly evolving.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Solve meaningful problems at real scale&lt;/strong&gt;: work on a complex, always-on marketplace that impacts millions every day.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;See your impact, fast&lt;/strong&gt;: ship, test, and improve ideas quickly in a low-hierarchy, high-ownership environment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Grow through challenge and ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: take on big, ambiguous problems and accelerate your career with strong support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;A culture built for builders&lt;/strong&gt;: high standards, collaboration, flexible working, and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Share in the success you help create&lt;/strong&gt;: competitive salary and equity, so you&#39;re rewarded for the impact you make.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine; our interview typically includes 3 to 4 stages.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workplace &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo we know that people are the heart of the business and we prioritise their welfare. Benefits differ by country, but we offer many benefits across areas including healthcare, well-being, parental leave, pensions, and generous annual leave allowances, including time off to support a charitable cause of your choice. Benefits are country-specific; please ask your recruiter for more information.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, we believe a great workplace is one that represents the world we live in and how beautifully diverse it can be. That means we have no judgement when it comes to any one of the things that make you who you are: your gender, race, sexuality, religion, or a secret aversion to coriander. All you need is a passion for (most) food and a desire to be part of one of the fastest-growing businesses in a rapidly growing industry.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are committed to diversity, equity and inclusion in all aspects of our hiring process. If you have a disability or long-term health condition, or require any reasonable adjustments to apply or fairly participate in the interview process, please let us know; we&#39;ll make every effort to ensure you have an equitable opportunity to succeed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Joblogic Story&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Established in 1998,&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Joblogic&lt;/strong&gt; is the UK’s #1 &lt;strong&gt;Field Service Management&lt;/strong&gt; (FSM) software platform. We are a global business with offices in the &lt;strong&gt;UK&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Pakistan&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Vietnam&lt;/strong&gt;. Since our management buy-out in 2013, we have grown from &lt;strong&gt;~£500K &lt;/strong&gt;ARR to &lt;strong&gt;~£35M+ &lt;/strong&gt;ARR and expanded our team from 11 to 500+ people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recently, we secured a strategic growth investment from &lt;strong&gt;Vista Equity Partners &lt;/strong&gt;— a global technology investor specialising in enterprise software. This investment includes over &lt;strong&gt;£100&lt;/strong&gt; million in new primary capital and will fuel our next phase of growth by accelerating our &lt;strong&gt;AI-first roadmap&lt;/strong&gt;, expanding our platform into CAFM (Computer-Aided Facilities Management) capabilities, and supporting our expansion across Europe and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With &lt;strong&gt;Vista’s &lt;/strong&gt;backing, we’re transforming from a successful UK business into a global scaling SaaS rocket ship, and we’d love for you to join us on our journey to &lt;strong&gt;£100M &lt;/strong&gt;ARR across international markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Joblogic &lt;/strong&gt;provides software to service contractors who install and maintain the built environment. Our platform helps businesses streamline operations, improve profitability, ensure compliance, and achieve rapid growth. With over &lt;strong&gt;100,000&lt;/strong&gt; users across industries including HVAC, plumbing, electrical maintenance, facilities management, and building fabric maintenance, we are entering a new era of intelligent automation, predictive maintenance, and data-driven decision-making for service firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are expanding our digital marketing team to support Joblogic’s ambitious growth plans. You’ll join a dynamic in-house marketing team, working closely with channel, content, creative and growth specialists. This role will report into the Digital Acquisition Specialist and will play an important part in driving lead generation, pipeline and brand growth through paid media.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As PPC Campaign Specialist, your primary focus will be paid search, with hands-on ownership of Google Ads and Microsoft Advertising. Paid social and wider paid digital channels are also an important part of the role, including Meta, LinkedIn, YouTube, Display and other relevant acquisition platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will manage and optimise campaigns day to day, analyse performance, improve lead quality and CPA, and support the delivery of a broader multi-channel acquisition strategy. You’ll be highly analytical, commercially minded and comfortable turning performance data into clear optimisation actions and recommendations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and optimise paid search campaigns across Google Ads and Microsoft Advertising as the role’s primary priority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan, launch and optimise paid social campaigns across Meta and LinkedIn, while supporting wider paid channels such as YouTube, Display, Demand Gen, review sites and other relevant platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage end-to-end campaign delivery, including setup, targeting, audiences, ad copy, creative briefs, QA, launch and ongoing optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor performance against key KPIs including MQL volume, CPA, conversion rate, lead quality, budget pacing and pipeline contribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct keyword, search-term, negative keyword, audience and creative analysis to improve traffic quality and campaign efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimise bidding, budgets, targeting, devices, schedules and landing-page alignment, and identify performance risks or opportunities proactively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse performance using advertising platforms, GA4 and CRM data, and provide clear recommendations and regular campaign updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Content, Creative, Brand, Web and external partners on landing pages, campaign assets, testing and new acquisition initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Essential Experience and Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on experience managing and optimising Google Ads and Microsoft Advertising, with paid search as a core area of expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience running paid social campaigns, particularly across LinkedIn Ads and Meta Ads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of campaign structure, keyword strategy, search terms, bidding, audiences and budget optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident using performance data to improve lead volume, lead quality, CPA and conversion performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using analytics and reporting tools such as GA4, Looker Studio or similar platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of conversion tracking, attribution and CRM-based lead reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with the ability to turn data into clear optimisation actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial understanding of B2B lead generation and how paid media contributes to qualified leads and pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organised and detail-oriented, with the ability to manage multiple campaigns and priorities independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills, with the confidence to work across Marketing, Content, Creative and other internal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience within B2B SaaS, technology or field service management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to additional paid media channels such as YouTube, Display, Demand Gen, programmatic advertising or review platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with advanced conversion tracking, including offline conversion imports or value-based optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of landing-page testing and conversion rate optimisation (CRO).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with marketing automation and CRM platforms such as HubSpot or Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of SEO fundamentals and how paid and organic search can work together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience working within a digital agency or fast-paced in-house acquisition team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid search campaigns are managed proactively, efficiently and with strong account hygiene.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid social and wider paid media activity is executed effectively and integrated with broader acquisition priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Campaigns generate high-quality leads efficiently against agreed CPA and performance targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance issues and growth opportunities are identified early, with clear actions and recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Budget pacing, testing and campaign reporting are accurate, consistent and commercially focused.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help make the world more hospitable &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The hospitality industry is uniquely human, and it deserves technology that’s just as inspiring as the people behind it. At Mews, we’re transforming the industry with a platform that helps hotels run smarter, move faster and create better guest experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work with smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do. You’ll have autonomy and the trust to make good decisions and move quickly. And you’ll enjoy a real sense of purpose as you see the impact of what we’re building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re motivated by ownership, curiosity and meaningful impact, and are driven to deliver consistent high performance, you’ll feel at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let&#39;s get into the specifics. It’s impossible to capture every nuance of a role – especially at a rapidly growing company like Mews – but if we had to distil it into a job description (which we do because this is a job description), it would be this:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This role owns Product and Engineering for Back of House, one of the most complex, multi-service domains on the Mews platform. Back of House covers the operational core that hotel teams rely on every day, and it needs someone who can set the product direction and run the engineering behind it, together. That combined mandate, product and engineering under one person at VP level, is rare, and the scale of hospitality technology right now makes it worth doing well.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll own the full domain: strategy, roadmap, and the engineering org that builds it, working closely and collaboratively with globally distributed teams across multiple time zones, and reporting into senior leadership. This isn&#39;t a narrow platform mandate. It spans product and engineering together, with the scope to make real calls on both, and the trust to run it as one connected domain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Back of House software has to stay reliable at all times and keep improving, without ever pausing customer delivery to get there. The next phase of this role is about applying AI directly to the systems that support hotel teams, not just internal tooling, at a scale most engineering leaders never get to work at.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Would Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own product and engineering strategy for Back of House end to end, across a genuinely multi-service architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run globally distributed engineering teams across multiple time zones, building the structures that let them ship together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build out a management team and develop senior ICs, growing a culture that holds up at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve reliability, performance and technical debt as ongoing disciplines, without stopping delivery to do it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Decide where AI genuinely belongs in the Back of House product, and ship AI-driven improvements that change how hotel teams work day to day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Fluency Level 4:&lt;/strong&gt; in this role that means going beyond using AI to move faster yourself. You&#39;ll decide where AI belongs in the Back of House product, understand the underlying models and infrastructure well enough to make real engineering calls about them, and have already shipped something where AI was a core part of the product, not a feature added on afterwards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For more information on AI fluency at Mews, please refer to &lt;a href=&quot;https://mews.atlassian.net/wiki/x/XQOskg&quot;&gt;AI Fluency at Mews: A Comprehensive Guide for Candidates&lt;/a&gt; on Confluence.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Would Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Combined Product and Engineering ownership at VP level, with clear, end-to-end ownership of a complex, multi-service product domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record running globally distributed engineering teams across multiple time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating inside a scaling SaaS business, ideally Series C through pre-IPO or recently public, as an operator rather than an adviser.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective people leadership: managing managers, developing senior ICs, and building healthy team cultures at scale, plus a track record of improving reliability, performance and technical debt without stopping delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI Fluency Level 4 or the equivalent hands-on experience: you&#39;ve shipped AI as a genuine part of a product, not just used it to speed up your own workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice To Have&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience in hospitality technology: PMS, POS, channel management, revenue management, or closely adjacent systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel tech experience (airlines, GDS, travel management companies), or comparable operationally critical, high-availability B2B platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Founder or early-stage builder experience, having built products from zero to scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Spain&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€220.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€280.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;UK&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£140,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£260,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Netherlands&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€220.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€280.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;France&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€220.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€280.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Germany&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€220.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€280.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Sweden&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;1 367 500 kr&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2 330 500 kr SEK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;United States &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$280,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$350,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Ireland&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€220.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€280.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary ranges are provided in good faith and reflect current market conditions and internal pay structures. Final compensation may be adjusted based on funding, budget constraints, or exceptional candidate qualifications, but will remain within reasonable proximity to the stated range.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This salary disclosure is provided in compliance with applicable pay transparency legislation. We are committed to equal pay practices and prohibit salary history inquiries during our recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If the location you&#39;re applying from wasn&#39;t originally advertised for this role, salary range information is available upon request at any point during the application/interview process - your recruiter will be able to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our success is powered by our incredible people, supported by benefits that help them thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No matter where you’re based, you’ll enjoy:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited paid holiday (yes, really)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in our company share program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave (6 months fully paid for primary caregivers, 2 months for secondary, available after one year of service)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual Learning budget of €300 (and more for high performers) to support your development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly &quot;EDGE&quot; time to Explore, Develop, Grow, and Elevate yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A work from anywhere policy with flexibility to work abroad for a few weeks each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation options, available after one year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, hybrid working options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A home office setup budget to make your workspace your own and a monthly work-from-home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Claude tokens, so you can automate workflows and build smarter, more efficient ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Local benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll receive additional benefits that vary by location, from healthcare and retirement plans to team events, socials and other perks. Ask us about it during your interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunities employer. We value teams that reflect the diversity of the customers and communities we serve. Different perspectives make better ideas, stronger products and a more welcoming company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also believe transparency is important when deciding if you&#39;re the right fit. Mews is an ambitious, high-pressure environment of continuous learning and high standards. Success here requires resilience, adaptability and a willingness to solve difficult problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A few things that define how we work:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High autonomy means high responsibility. People are expected to take ownership and drive outcomes. There isn’t a detailed playbook for everything, and that’s part of what makes the work challenging – and rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change is constant. We’re growing quickly and adapting as we scale. Teams, processes and priorities continue to evolve, and only people who stay curious and agile will thrive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re remote-first, not relationship-free. Flexibility is core to how we work, but strong relationships still matter. Our teams are global, so we need expert collaborators and communicators to help us move forward together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI is an integral part of our processes. It’s not here to steal people’s jobs, but to amplify efficiency and productivity. We’re motivated to proactively use the technology to seek out better ways of working and share our findings with the rest of the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If there&#39;s anything we can do to support you during the application process, let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don&#39;t discriminate on the basis of race, religion, colour, nationality, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One final thing: don&#39;t hold back. If you don&#39;t meet 100% of the criteria in this job description but you&#39;re certain you could make a big impact, apply. Everyone should have equal access to opportunities, and we&#39;re committed to providing an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If Mews sounds like the kind of environment where you&#39;d thrive, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GROPYUS is a technology-based construction company focused on building multi-story residential buildings. Thanks to its prefabricated building system with various design options, industrial offsite construction, and fully digitalized processes, the company manufactures aspirational, sustainable, and affordable homes using timber construction methods. GROPYUS is using scalable construction and manufacturing solutions to tap into a future market, boost Europe&#39;s strength in innovation, while also playing a substantial role in improving sustainability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Über die Rolle&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Du möchtest die Zukunft des Wohnens aktiv mitgestalten – mit Fokus auf die Umsetzung? Du möchtest ein Team bilden, das mit Spaß an der Arbeit eine gute Performance erreicht? Als Senior Projektleiter/in - Bau / Senior Project Manager (w/m/d) bei uns, einem innovativen Generalübernehmer im nachhaltigen Wohnbau, übernimmst du die Verantwortung für die Bauprojekte von der Bauantragseinreichung bis zur schlüsselfertigen Übergabe an einen zufriedenen Kunden. Du bist dafür zuständig, dass unsere Wohnbauprojekte (ab 4.500 m2 BGF aufwärts) termin- und qualitätsgerecht realisiert werden und verantwortest dabei die Kosten und Zahlungsströme. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Insbesondere werden deine Aufgaben umfassen:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eigenverantwortliche Planung, Koordination und Steuerung von Bauprojekten im Roh- und Schlüsselfertigbau unter Berücksichtigung der wirtschaftlichen und technischen Zielsetzung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Termingerechte und qualitätssichere Umsetzung des vertraglichen Bau-Solls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kontrolle des Bauablaufs und der Baustellenergebnisse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Koordinieren und überwachen der Einsätze von Fachingenieuren, Fachberater, Personal sowie Nachunternehmen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Führung und Organisation des Baustellenteams und Verantwortung über die Personaleinsatzplanung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Management von Kosten und Zahlungsströmen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verhandlungsführung mit Auftraggebern und Nachunternehmen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nachtragsgestaltung und -durchsetzung gegenüber den Auftraggebern&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Über dich&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Einen Studienabschluss in der Fachrichtung Bauingenieurwesen oder Architektur bzw. eine vergleichbare Qualifikation &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung in der Projektleitung beim Bau von Großprojekten, idealerweise bei einem GU oder GÜ &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reisebereitschaft zu unseren Baustellen deutschlandweit - du trägst die Projektverantwortung und entscheidest selbst, wann deine &amp;nbsp;Anwesenheit vor Ort notwendig ist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Einen sicheren im Umgang mit Office Produkten (Excel, Word...) und gängigen Projekt Management Softwares&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung in der Ressourceneinsatzplanung, Lean Construction ist ein Plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Einen transparenten und kooperativen Kommunikationsstil sowie ein starkes Verhandlungsgeschick und Durchsetzungsvermögen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Teamgeist und eine selbstständige sowie verantwortungsbewusste Arbeitsweise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Begeisterung für digitale Anwendungen und innovative Prozessgestaltung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fließende Deutsch und gute Englischkenntnisse&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Was wir bieten&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ein unbefristeter Vertrag mit 30 Urlaubstagen.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Attraktive Zusatzleistungen: Wir bieten eine betriebliche Altersvorsorge, Sprachkurse (Englisch/Deutsch) und Mitarbeiterrabatte bei ausgewählten nachhaltigen Marken. Darüber hinaus unterstützen Dich unsere externen Partner im Bereich mentale Gesundheit, um Deine psychische Gesundheit durch anonyme Einzel- oder Gruppensitzungen zu stärken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Virtuelles Aktienprogramm: Profitiere von GROPYUS Erfolg durch unser Virtuelles Aktienprogramm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Eigenverantwortung: Du kannst wirklich etwas bewirken – auf allen Ebenen unserer Organisation. Finde Lösungen, treibe sie voran, teste und implementiere sie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Die Chance, Teil von etwas Großem zu sein: Unsere Mission ist es, eine ganze Branche neu zu denken. Hilf uns dabei, das Bauwesen neu zu erfinden und nachhaltiges, erschwingliches Wohnen zu fördern.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Ein vielfältiges und bereicherndes Arbeitsumfeld: Werde ein geschätztes Mitglied eines wunderbar vielfältigen Teams von Menschen aus über 50 Ländern. Bei GROPYUS legen wir großen Wert auf Inklusion und sorgen dafür, dass sich jeder – unabhängig von seinem Hintergrund – als Teil der Gemeinschaft fühlt. So werden unsere Unterschiede zu Stärken, die uns als Team weiterbringen.&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Join us on our mission to design buildings as continuously evolving products to create the most exciting and affordable experience for all. We build for people and conserve the resources of our planet.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We can&#39;t wait to get to know you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;For more information, visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://gropyus.com/&quot;&gt;website&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage – Assistant(e) Communication &amp;amp; Événementiel (Hackathons Adopt AI)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Type de contrat :&lt;/strong&gt; Stage (6 mois)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Début :&lt;/strong&gt; Septembre 2026&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lieu :&lt;/strong&gt; Paris 9e&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;À propos d&#39;Artefact Adopt AI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez &lt;strong&gt;Artefact Adopt AI&lt;/strong&gt;, nous concevons et organisons des &lt;a href=&quot;https://adoptai.artefact.com/content/hackathons&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;hackathons d&#39;innovation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;sur des enjeux technologiques et sociétaux majeurs. Notre objectif, en lien avec des grands acteurs publics et privés : réunir étudiants, développeurs, entrepreneurs, chercheurs et experts métiers pour faire émerger, en quelques jours, des idées et des prototypes concrets répondant à des problématiques réelles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Du 2 au 4 décembre 2026, nos hackathons s&#39;installeront au Grand Palais lors d&#39;&lt;a href=&quot;https://adoptai.artefact.com/&quot;&gt;Adopt AI&lt;/a&gt;, le plus grand salon européen dédié à l&#39;IA, rassemblant des milliers de participants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pour nous accompagner dans la communication et l&#39;organisation de nos hackathons – avant, pendant et après Adopt AI, nous recherchons un(e) &lt;strong&gt;Assistant(e) Communication &amp;amp; Événementiel.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tes missions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rattaché(e) à l&#39;équipe et sous la responsabilité de la responsable communication et événementielle, tes missions couvriront les deux piliers majeurs de nos projets :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Communication &amp;amp; Contenus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Création de supports visuels : Conception de visuels, kits de communication, newsletters, publications LinkedIn, supports print (kakémonos, signalétique, fonds de stand, goodies).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rédaction &amp;amp; Animation : Rédaction des supports destinés aux participants, intervenants, sponsors et clients. Animation des canaux de communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Valorisation événementielle : Mise à jour des pages web/présentations et médiatisation des hackathons et temps forts (avant, pendant et après l&#39;événement).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Gestion &amp;amp; Production Événementielle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pré-événement :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordination avec les différents prestataires (lieu, catering, scénographie, mobilier) et gestion des commandes / goodies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation à la construction des documents supports (planning événementiel, agendas/déroulés, staffing, briefs des prestataires).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aide à la gestion et au suivi budgétaire&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Jour J (Pendant l&#39;événement) :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Présence sur site pour épauler la régie et l&#39;équipe de production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordination logistique des prestataires, flux et livraisons.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accueil et garantie de la meilleure expérience possible pour les participants, sponsors et VIPs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Post-événement :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Suivi du démontage, retours logistiques, bilan budgétaire et facturation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication post-événement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Roadmap indicative de ton stage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sept. :&lt;/strong&gt; Prise en main des outils, préparation et lancement des premières actions de com&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Oct. :&lt;/strong&gt; Intensification de la com &amp;amp; lancement de la logistique événementielle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nov. :&lt;/strong&gt; Rush Pré-event (com intensive &amp;amp; dernier sprint de l’organisation opérationnelle)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Déc. :&lt;/strong&gt; Jour J au Grand Palais (présence sur le terrain, gestion live de l’événement)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Janv. – Fév. :&lt;/strong&gt; Bilan, REX, valorisation post-event &amp;amp; continuation des projets comm/event&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil recherché&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Formation :&lt;/strong&gt; Étudiant(e) en Master (Bac+4/5) en Communication, Événementiel, Marketing ou École de Commerce.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outils &amp;amp; Compétences :&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
